  "description": "MimeKit is an Open Source library for creating and parsing MIME, S/MIME and PGP messages on desktop and mobile platforms. It also supports parsing of Unix mbox files.\n\n      MimeKit.Cryptography extends MimeKit.Core with support for S/MIME, PGP/MIME, DKIM, ARC and DMARC using BouncyCastle.Cryptography. Reference this package (or the MimeKit meta-package) when you need cryptography features.\n\n      API documentation can be found on the web at http://www.mimekit.net/docs\n\n      For those that need SMTP, POP3 or IMAP support, check out https://github.com/jstedfast/MailKit",
  "iconFile": "icons\\mimekit-50.png",
